        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Free and private: correction and topic analysis run on your Mac, the text goes nowhere. Slower than an online model, especially on the first call. Start Ollama or LM Studio with a downloaded model, then pick it in Correction."
